# Git

- Branches: `cursor/short-description`.
- Commit only when asked. Push only when asked.
- Ignore `.venv/`, `__pycache__/`, secrets.
- Message: imperative, why not a file list. Example: `Add a small Flask page to convert HKD to USD.`
- No `git config` changes, `--no-verify`, force push, or amending pushed commits.

See `AGENTS.md` for the full project conventions.
